cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use, cite or modify duckmind, please credit it as below
  and link the repository.
title: duckmind
type: software
authors:
  - alias: joseyarashio
repository-code: "https://github.com/joseyarashio/duckmind"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  duckmind gives a small robot duck a mind of its own: who it is, its moods,
  its memories, the people it knows, what it wants to do, and what it learns.
  It is written for robots compatible with Microduck and comes with a
  browser simulator.
keywords:
  - robot pet
  - Microduck
  - simulator
  - MuJoCo
